{#- Atlas — surface two: triage on a phone (decision 27).

  Not a squeezed depth chart. On a phone the question is never "how far has this got" but "why has
  it stopped", so the cards are ordered by what needs the owner and every card ends on its gate.

  The order decision 27 fixes:

    1. waiting on a decision — the workstream is designed but not approved, or its next milestone
       is gated, or nothing is left on record for it to do
    2. moving   — a milestone is in flight
    3. blocked  — work is parked on something outside the workstream
    4. designing
    5. not started

  Ties keep the order the config declared, so two cards in the same state never swap places
  between builds.

  Data this layout expects:
    ladder      — { rows, columns } as computeLadder returned it
    workstreams — the array resolveWorkstreams produced, in the SAME order as ladder.columns
    project, repo, title — see base.njk
-#}
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% import "base.njk" as ui %}

{% block bodyClass %}page page-mobile{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<h1>What needs you</h1>
<p class="lede">Ordered by what is waiting on a decision, not by name. Every card ends on the gate that is holding it.</p>

<ul class="card-list">
{%- for wanted in ["awaiting-decision", "moving", "blocked", "designing", "not-started"] -%}
{%- for stream in workstreams -%}
{%- set column = ladder.columns[loop.index0] -%}
{#- Which of the five states this workstream is in. Stage first, because a workstream that has
    not started designing yet cannot be moving whatever its milestone list says. -#}
{%- set hasNext = false -%}
{%- set hasParked = false -%}
{%- set doneCount = 0 -%}
{%- for entry in stream.manifest.milestones -%}
{%- if entry.status == "next" %}{% set hasNext = true %}{% endif -%}
{%- if entry.status == "parked" %}{% set hasParked = true %}{% endif -%}
{%- if entry.status == "done" %}{% set doneCount = doneCount + 1 %}{% endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- set triage = "awaiting-decision" -%}
{%- if stream.manifest.stage == "not-started" -%}
{%- set triage = "not-started" -%}
{%- elif stream.manifest.stage == "designing" -%}
{%- set triage = "designing" -%}
{%- elif stream.manifest.stage == "planned" -%}
{#- Designed, not approved: the approval is the owner's to give. -#}
{%- set triage = "awaiting-decision" -%}
{%- elif hasNext -%}
{%- set triage = "moving" -%}
{%- elif hasParked -%}
{%- set triage = "blocked" -%}
{%- endif -%}
{% if triage == wanted %}
<li>
<article class="card" data-workstream="{{ stream.manifest.codename }}" data-triage="{{ triage }}">
<header class="card-head">
<h2><a href="/workstream/{{ stream.slug }}/">{{ stream.manifest.codename }}</a></h2>
{{ ui.chip("triage", triage) }}
</header>
<p class="card-what">{{ stream.manifest.what }}</p>
<p class="card-position">{{ stream.manifest.position }}</p>
{% if stream.manifest.milestones | length %}
<div class="track" role="img" aria-label="{{ doneCount }} of {{ stream.manifest.milestones | length }} milestones complete">
{% for entry in stream.manifest.milestones %}<span class="track-seg{% if loop.index0 < doneCount %} is-filled{% endif %}"></span>{% endfor %}
</div>
<p class="track-count"><span class="num">{{ doneCount }}</span> of <span class="num">{{ stream.manifest.milestones | length }}</span> milestones complete</p>
{% else %}
<p class="track-count empty">No milestones on record yet</p>
{% endif %}
<p class="card-next">Next: {{ column.tipLabel }}</p>
<p class="card-gate"><span class="card-gate-label">Gate</span>{{ stream.manifest.gate }}</p>
</article>
</li>
{% endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{% endblock %}
